### 回显请求（切换到 echo 环境：标题栏右上角）
# @name anything
POST {{baseUrl}}/anything?from=callme
X-Request-Id: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hello": "world", "n": {{$randomInt}}}

### 跟随重定向
# @name redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/redirect/2

### 不跟随重定向
# @name stay
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/redirect/2
